Hi, I didn't find any other way currently.

Also, notice the interface is about the
```
public function onAuthenticationSuccess(Request $request, TokenInterface $token): Response
```
method, while I modify the
```
public function handleAuthenticationSuccess(UserInterface $user, $jwt = null): Response
```
method which is already free from any interface.

The `handleAuthenticationSuccess` was initially created to allow passing a specificy `$jwt` in https://github.com/lexik/LexikJWTAuthenticationBundle/pull/283, therefor adding the `$data` param follow the same philosophy.

